          "comment": "Group 2 winner; joint top-rated of these on BHA figures so shouldn't be underestimated",
          "spotlight": "Group 2 winner over 1m on soft ground last autumn when having only his fifth race; perhaps found 7f on the sharp side when well held in a Group 3 at York on his return; joint top-rated of these on BHA figures so shouldn't be underestimated.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-09-27",
              "horse": "Prague",
              "horse_id": "hrs_30941099",
              "race": "Al Basti Equiworld, Dubai Joel Stakes (Group 2)",
              "race_id": "rac_11374402",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "We may have to think about supplementing Prague for the Queen Elizabeth II Stakes on Champions Day. We knew he would be competitive after he worked nicely on the watered gallop next to the track the other day - Dylan Cunha, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-06-15",
              "horse": "Prague",
              "horse_id": "hrs_30941099",
              "race": "Darley British EBF Maiden Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11286080",
              "course": "Sandown",
              "course_id": "crs_1404",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2189",
              "quote": "Prague was in the horses in training sale at the end of the year and we bought him for ten grand. I don't know how good he could be. He's not done much at home. I've only been training five and ten grand horses so for me to get one formerly trained by Aidan O'Brien proves what we could do with real horses but we're just not getting them. He's a big colt and we've just taken our time. The best thing about it is he's owned by our best lad, who walked around the sale for days and eventually found him. He's the best looked after horse in the yard - Dylan Cunha, trainer."
            }
          ],
