          "spotlight": "Well treated on form as recent as early 2024; however, this 8yo was a long way below his best last May-August and was soundly beaten at Haydock (100-1) last Saturday on his first run since.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-01-25",
              "horse": "Enemy",
              "horse_id": "hrs_19768546",
              "race": "BetUK Winter Derby Trial Conditions Stakes",
              "race_id": "rac_11147630",
              "course": "Southwell (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10244",
              "distance_f": "11",
              "distance_y": "2443",
              "quote": "We were just looking for an opportunity with Enemy and he was in a handicap at Kempton later in the week, but we thought we'd take this chance. It's a severe drop back in trip and he's beaten quite a classy field. Although they didn't go fast, they took each other on from the beginning of the straight and that gave him a chance just to sneak into it behind and finish as strongly as he did. I was mightily impressed with him. He's getting older now, but he hasn't lost any of his ability - Ian Williams, trainer, speaking on Sky Sports Racing."
            },
            {
              "date": "2019-09-06",
              "horse": "Enemy",
              "horse_id": "hrs_19768546",
              "race": "Charbonnel Et Walker British EBF Maiden Stakes (Plus 10 Race) (Sire And Dam Restricted Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_9580974",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "John was pleased with Enemy at home and said he was ready to start off but might be a little bit babyish. He learnt as the race progressed and it was a lovely result first time out. On paper Law Of Peace set a fair benchmark. He looks as though he could go seven again or up to a mile. He seems to have a nice future and that's a great starting point - Oisin Murphy, rider."
            }
          ],
