          "comment": "Improving 3yo; much the best of the low numbers over C&D latest; up 4lb but more to come",
          "spotlight": "Much improved for the addition of a tongue-tie and switch to handicaps, winning a 6f nursery at Yarmouth last September and progressing again this year when third at Sandown before rewarding strong support at Chester (both 5f, good); another step forward when doing best of the low numbers in the Palace Of Holyroodhouse over C&D three weeks ago; 4lb higher but set to go well once more.",
