              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1115",
              "quote": "They've gone really hard and the draw was very helpful. Redorange has got a great mind for a sprinter and most importantly so much speed. We're really excited about him - he's very talented. He's improved from two to three and gelding him might have helped. He could be a horse we're thinking about for the [Palace Of] Holyroodhouse at Royal Ascot - Clive Cox, trainer."
