          "comment": "Good C&D record; unlucky in running last time and she's more appealing than many",
          "spotlight": "Has an excellent record over C&D and she wasn't beaten far in this race 12 months ago; a couple of promising Windsor runs this summer and she looked set to challenge for at least a place at Newcastle two weeks ago, only to find her path blocked in the final furlong (eased immediately); likely to be involved.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "She seems to be an Ascot specialist- she loves the place and goes there again for the big £100,000 handicap this week. After that, all being well, she'll go- like Amazonian Dream- for the sprint final at Windsor on August 12. She's done very well over 5f (and won a qualifier over 5f at Windsor), but for £75,000 we'll have a crack over 6f. 11-07-24"
            }
          ],
