          "comment": "Rattled home to win at Epsom on Derby day; got going too late here at the Royal meeting",
          "spotlight": "Came with a strong late run to win the 3yo Dash on Derby day; got going too late over C&D at the Royal meeting; could still have more to come and this could set up favourably.",
