          "comment": "Hard to win with but talented and in form; more minor money on the cards",
          "spotlight": "Hugely talented and he's been a model of consistency since December, most recently finishing third of 19 in the Dash on Derby day; conditions no problem and another promising 7lb claimer takes his chance in the saddle; more minor money on the cards.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-07",
              "horse": "Existent",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21673022",
              "race": "Aston Martin \"Dash\" Handicap (Heritage Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_11635663",
              "course": "Epsom",
              "course_id": "crs_442",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Rose [Dawes] has given Existent a good ride and steered him through pretty well. No complaints there, and we are very pleased with the run. He's won nearly 50,000GBP in prize money this year just from being second and third - Stuart Williams, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-04-30",
              "horse": "Existent",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21673022",
              "race": "Betfair Palace House Stakes (Group 3)",
              "race_id": "rac_10512502",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Existent is a nice straightforward horse to deal with and hopefully he will now go on to the King's Stand Stakes. Tom (Morley, owner) and his mum have won the race twice before and we entered him for it last week. It is a bit of an ask, being rated 101, but we think he definitely warranted an entry and I think it should suit him. I think five is his best trip for us - Stuart Williams, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-10-03",
              "horse": "Existent",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21673022",
              "race": "Prestige Agri Maiden Stakes (Plus 10 Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_9961029",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "The race didn't go right at Ascot and Existent didn't come out of the race the way we would have liked. He's a strong horse now and as long as he's in good order then we'll look to go to the Horris Hill with him - John Gosden, trainer."
            }
          ],
