          "comment": "On a good mark and ran well for 2nd at Doncaster on Thursday; capable of another big run",
          "spotlight": "7f specialist; well handicapped on last season's best and he comes here on the back of some good runs at Doncaster, the latest on Thursday when finishing off well for second; placed in the 7f handicap at Royal Ascot in 2021 so the track is no issue; likely to be in the thick of it if turned out quickly.",
