          "comment": "Good second in 6f AW Group 3 two weeks ago; just as effective at 7f; should go well",
          "spotlight": "Tremendous money-spinner who was back to somewhere approaching his best when second in the Group 3 Chipchase at Newcastle (6f, AW) a fortnight ago; raced predominantly at sprint trips but one of his four 7f starts resulted in a valuable win in Saudi in early 2024; should go well.",
