          "comment": "Triple course winner who was runner-up at Carlisle latest; respected back in trip",
          "spotlight": "Her first three wins were at this track and last success was off 2lb higher at Redcar (6f, good to firm) last July; mixed results in five runs this year but her latest front-running second at Carlisle (6f, soft) was a decent effort behind a progressive 3yo; has claims if she can back that up and this drop back in trip should be fine.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-18",
              "horse": "Stormy Pearl",
              "horse_id": "hrs_30285465",
              "race": "Every Race Live On Racing TV Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11325574",
              "course": "Hamilton",
              "course_id": "crs_572",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1326",
              "quote": "That was a lot closer than I originally thought, but at least we can call Stormy Pearl a winner again, which is great. I couldn't see anything between them in the photo but if she had kept a little bit straighter she may have been a clear winner, but that's racing and it was great to see her run so well. She's a lovely filly who's usually consistent and seems to really like the place. We'll be back this season we hope, don't you worry about that! - David Thompson, trainer."
            }
          ],
