              "quote": "Two Auld Pals definitely likes the track - he's a Hamilton specialist. I'm very pleased for him and he deserves to win. I thought he was coming back to form last time. He's on a mark where he could probably follow up because of his attitude and bravery. We're going to keep him on the Flat for a little while longer and might mix hurdling in the future - Lucinda Russell, trainer."
