          "comment": "On reduced mark but last win was in 2022 and others are more convincing",
          "spotlight": "Two wins over 1m (good) in Ireland but last success was in 2022 and he's been well held in three starts for current yard; on reduced mark and may have needed his reappearance run here (1m1f, good) last month but others are more convincing.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2021-10-16",
              "horse": "Good Heavens",
              "horse_id": "hrs_26116804",
              "race": "Irish EBF Supporting TREO EILE (C & G) Maiden",
              "race_id": "rac_10343411",
              "course": "Leopardstown",
              "course_id": "crs_4862",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "His experience stood to him and it was a good performance. I'm not sure what they are like behind Good Heavens but he couldn't have done it any better today. Getting a lead was a good help to him and he quickened up well - Frank Berry, representing owner JP McManus."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He has plenty of experience from the Flat and has schooled well over hurdles. His Flat form is good enough to suggest he can make the grade as a juvenile hurdler. He went very close off a mark of 98 in the Irish Cambridgeshire, only just beaten by one of our four-year-olds. He's a homebred out of an unraced Galileo mare, so it's not a jumping pedigree, but we've had horses by Zoffany who have taken well to hurdling, and I'm looking forward to getting him started. 20-10-22"
            }
          ],
