          "comment": "Fourth in 2yo Group 2 here; midfield at Royal Ascot; not ruled out back in calmer waters",
          "spotlight": "Highlight of last year's 2yo campaign was her fourth in the Group 2 Duchess Of Cambridge here (6f, good); reappeared with fair Listed third at Lingfield (7f, AW) in March then mid-division in the Sandringham Handicap at Royal Ascot (1m, good to firm); not ruled out now back in calmer waters.",
