          "spotlight": "Record of 4-7 over 7f includes a success on the other course here in May and it's best to forgive his most recent effort at this trip (something looked amiss); good third in the Wokingham over 6f last time; due to go up 2lb in future; largely progressive and remains of strong interest.",
