          "comment": "Progressive over 6f for new stable, strong-finishing second in the Wokingham last time",
          "spotlight": "Has shown useful and progressive form over 6f this term for new stable, winning twice on the other Newmarket track then strong-finishing second (nearly got up) in the Wokingham at Royal Ascot; due to go up 3lb in future; looks ready for this step back up in distance and commands respect.",
