          "comment": "In top form since stepped back up to 7f, second at Royal Ascot last time; big player",
          "spotlight": "Back in top form since stepped back up to 7f, readily winning from Billyjoh at Doncaster then second in Royal Ascot handicap; nicely ahead of the assessor (future mark is 4lb higher) and appears to have a big prize in him; booking of William Buick cements the strong case; huge player.",
