          "comment": "Below form last Saturday, extending his long losing sequence; opposed",
          "spotlight": "Disappointing favourite at Haydock last Saturday, extending his long losing sequence; beaten twice in this contest (seventh in 2023, well held in 2024) and can be opposed.",
