          "owner": "Sheikh Mohammed Obaid Al Maktoum",
          "owner_id": "own_221344",
          "prev_trainers": [],
          "prev_owners": [],
          "comment": "Good chance on best form but he was only fifth when favourite in this race last year",
          "spotlight": "Inconsistent since winning the 2024 Commonwealth Cup and was below par returned to Royal Ascot last time, failing to back up his reappearance success (beat Flora Of Bermuda) in the Duke of York Stakes; well capable of being involved but isn't guaranteed to give his running; beaten favourite (finished only fifth) in this race 12 months ago; wears first-time headgear.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-05-14",
              "horse": "Inisherin",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37276099",
              "race": "1895 Duke Of York Clipper Stakes (Group 2)",
              "race_id": "rac_11575642",
              "course": "York",
              "course_id": "crs_2782",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "That's the first hurdle jumped. We lost a month with Inisherin when we realised we had a bit of an issue and with the weather and the ground, we couldn't get a racecourse gallop into him. Things were stacking up against us. Thankfully he's working a lot more relaxed. He's a year older and a big colt, and he'll go straight to Ascot now. Ryan was going to jump and be positive, but it actually worked out well for us. He was to keep half filling him up - if he'd have gone with him he may have lost by two lengths at the end. We know what Ryan is, he's brilliant. I said to him as always what he does is right. He ran well in the Guineas and has lots of speed. I wouldn't be against coming here for the upgraded Group 1 later this year as I'd like to support it - Kevin Ryan, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-06-21",
              "horse": "Inisherin",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37276099",
              "race": "Commonwealth Cup (Group 1) (British Champions Series) (No Geldings)",
              "race_id": "rac_11254932",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Inisherin improved from Haydock. I think he is just going to get quicker and better at this job. He's a joy to train. He's an absolute legend. It was a very easy watch. Obviously very different ground than how it was at Haydock, which always makes you nervous. But he is a great striding horse. I was nervous about the ground going to Haydock, with it being soft. Then obviously when he won on that type of ground but he hardly bends his knees - Kevin Ryan, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-05-25",
              "horse": "Inisherin",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37276099",
              "race": "Betfred Supports Jack Berry House Sandy Lane Stakes (Group 2)",
              "race_id": "rac_11268023",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "I was always in my comfort zone, Inisherin is a very good horse - it makes life easy! It was solid form in the Guineas. You always think coming to sprinting will he be quick enough? But Kevin was always very confident of that. It's only his fourth start so he's a horse very much on the up and just finding his feet. I don't know what the plan is now but he's got plenty of speed and there will be plenty of options - Tom Eaves, rider."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "Everyone was in full agreement to supplement him after the Sandy Lane. He'd run a huge race in the Guineas and he had them in trouble a long way out at Haydock. That's a good trial for the Commonwealth and he deserves to go there as one of the leading fancies. He's only run four times and had eight months of racing, so there could be plenty more to come from him. 10-06-24"
            }
          ],
