          "comment": "Came up well short in the Commonwealth Cup; again deserted by Ryan Moore",
          "spotlight": "Group 3 winner as a 2yo; creditable second in Listed races won by stablemate Whistlejacket and Symbol Of Honour this spring but came up well short in the Commonwealth Cup and still needs to prove he's a Group 1 colt; deserted by Ryan Moore for the third time this year.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-04-26",
              "horse": "Ides Of March",
              "horse_id": "hrs_41661508",
              "race": "Irish Stallion Farms EBF Committed Stakes (Listed Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11618555",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1280",
              "quote": "You would have to be delighted with Ides Of March too. I thought the ground was way too soft for him, he's a very good mover and is way better on fast ground. He's a good traveller, a high cruiser and doesn't lie down easily - Aidan O'Brien, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-08-31",
              "horse": "Ides Of March",
              "horse_id": "hrs_41661508",
              "race": "Heider Family Stables Round Tower Stakes (Group 3)",
              "race_id": "rac_11382267",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Ides Of March is powerful, fast horse. He finds it very easy to go quick. He travelled very easy through the race and he ran straight today. He looks like a Middle Park horse - Aidan O'Brien, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-08-10",
              "horse": "Ides Of March",
              "horse_id": "hrs_41661508",
              "race": "Revamp Conservation And Restoration Irish EBF Maiden",
              "race_id": "rac_11366628",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Ides Of March could be a group sprinter. He's big, powerful and he's fast. He could go for the Middle Park and maybe have a run before that - Aidan O'Brien, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He wants it quick. When he gets his ground he's a very fast sprinter, and everything has gone well in the build-up. We've always thought the Commonwealth Cup would suit him. 13-06-25"
            }
          ],
