          "comment": "Unexposed; ran well in the Jersey last time; could make a bold bid from the front",
          "spotlight": "Supplemented for this race at a cost of £36,000 and he's the least exposed contender, having raced only four times (all this year); soon clear and wasn't for catching over 6f at Yarmouth on penultimate start, then good second over 7f in the Jersey at Royal Ascot; takes another step up in class but is open to further progress and could make a bold bid from the front.",
