          "comment": "Some good runs in UAE/Qatar earlier this year but may be vulnerable off his current mark",
          "spotlight": "Short-headed in 3yo Listed race at Epsom (7f) last May and he ran some good races in defeat in Qatar and UAE between last November and this March; however, there's a suspicion he's vulnerable off his current mark.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-09-10",
              "horse": "Native American",
              "horse_id": "hrs_35554603",
              "race": "Tattersalls Ireland Super Auction Sale Stakes",
              "race_id": "rac_11004110",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "6.5",
              "distance_y": "1383",
              "quote": "Native American will keep improving with racing and time. He took me there nicely but I would say he's just bone idle in front. The ground was as slow as he would like it. He could be a stakes horse in time - Colin Keane, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-05-27",
              "horse": "Native American",
              "horse_id": "hrs_35554603",
              "race": "Collective Green Energy EBF Restricted Novice Stakes (Bands A, B, C & D) (EBF Qualifier) (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_10913500",
              "course": "York",
              "course_id": "crs_2782",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Native American has shown plenty at home and he will stay further in time, so we weren't sure about six furlongs. He's quickened up and put the race to bed nicely. He's done a couple of nice bits of work at home, but he'll definitely improve from that - Oisin Orr, jockey."
            }
          ],
