          "comment": "Mixed results this year but has won the last two runnings; could have major part to play",
          "spotlight": "7yo whose form has been mixed this year but he kept on for a fair fifth over 7f here four weeks ago; has won the last two runnings of this race (good to soft) and was second in 2022 (good to firm); could have a major part to play now back up in trip.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-13",
              "horse": "Blue For You",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21912163",
              "race": "John Smith's Racing Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11317007",
              "course": "York",
              "course_id": "crs_2782",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1732",
              "quote": "Blue For You seems to like this track. We've tried him at Ascot a few times and it's never worked, but he's bounced back from a terrible run down there. It's horses for courses. He normally shows his best here. We'll do the same thing and go to Goodwood and then come back for the mile race here at the Ebor meeting - David O'Meara, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-07-15",
              "horse": "Blue For You",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21912163",
              "race": "John Smith's Racing Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_10962614",
              "course": "York",
              "course_id": "crs_2782",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1732",
              "quote": "He's a very good horse who travelled really nicely. Blue For You got the openings today and at Ascot last time he boiled over before he got to the start - we were happy to draw a line through that. He does like it here and he'll come back here next month. He might do Goodwood in between as well - David O'Meara, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-07-08",
              "horse": "Blue For You",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21912163",
              "race": "Plusvital Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_10252437",
              "course": "Leopardstown",
              "course_id": "crs_4862",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Ble For You got a very good ride. He just found that little bit more late on. He won at Galway last year and he might go back there for a handicap - Dermot Weld, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-07-27",
              "horse": "Blue For You",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21912163",
              "race": "Claregalwayhotel.ie Irish EBF (C & G) Maiden (Plus 10 Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_9925357",
              "course": "Galway",
              "course_id": "crs_4758",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "We hoped he'd run well but obviously others appeared to be in better form coming into the race. He had to improve from his first run but we were optimistic he'd handle the ground. It did look unlikely in the dip and he is still a big raw horse. He toughed it out well and has shown a good attitude and hopefully he'll be up to Stakes level - Kris Weld, assistant to Dermot Weld, trainer"
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He'll run this month in preparation for York in May, which is his track. He's also run well at Goodwood, but we now know he doesn't like Ascot. He looks well and should have more life in him. 14-04-25"
            }
          ],
