          "comment": "Talented in his prime but below par when last seen; best watched back from absence",
          "spotlight": "Runner-up in Group 2 at Meydan in December 2023; failed to replicate that form in UAE subsequently and well beaten at Galway last July on sole run for Paddy Twomey; absent since and this 7yo is probably best watched now starting out for another new yard.",
