          "comment": "Started his season well but merely mid-division over this C&D on his last two starts",
          "spotlight": "Runner-up in double-figure fields on first two starts this season (1m/1m2f, good) but merely mid-division over this C&D on his last two starts and it seems likely he'll be vulnerable once more.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-06-02",
              "horse": "Austrian Theory",
              "horse_id": "hrs_25082281",
              "race": "Racehorse Lotto Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_10915190",
              "course": "Epsom",
              "course_id": "crs_442",
              "distance_f": "8.5",
              "distance_y": "1873",
              "quote": "We've always thought a lot of Austrian Theory and he was a very talented two-year-old. I thought he was a real Golden Mile type for Goodwood last year but he can be a bit in and out. His run at Chester last weekend was a sign he was coming back to the boil and Joe Fanning was sublime on the front end. The straight track handicaps don't really suit him and, albeit the plan didn't come off last year, we'll be working back from the Golden Mile again - Charlie Johnston, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's a grand horse who we bought from the Horses In Training Sale in Newmarket. He's not quite ready to run yet, but we're looking forward to him this summer. I'm still learning about him, but I'd expect him to want a mile and good ground and to be running at some of the bigger meetings. 23-04-24"
            }
          ],
