          "comment": "Two good runs in defeat at Royal Ascot last month; needs others to underperform today",
          "spotlight": "Twice ran well in defeat at Royal Ascot last month, finishing third in the Copper Horse Handicap (1m6f, good to firm) and second in the Queen Alexandra (2m5f, good to firm; albeit no match for the winner); could give a good account but needs others to underperform if he's to come out on top.",
