          "comment": "Listed winner on final 3yo start; absent since but interesting nevertheless",
          "spotlight": "Made it four wins from his eight starts when landing a Listed race at Ascot (1m6f, soft) last October; has also won on fast ground; returns from an absence but he's in good hands to continue to progress and it will be no surprise if this 4yo has a part to play now up in grade on his comeback.",
