              "quote": "The stiffer track suited Rampage today. We were a bit worried about the ground but he showed us he is well able for it. We took a while to get to know him but he seems to be in a good vein of form. He was due his head in front again. It opened up well for me, he got the splits at the right time and when he gets there he just does enough - James Ryan, jockey."
