          "comment": "Five-time winner on AW; last win came here last year off 65; some positive runs this term",
          "spotlight": "Five-time winner on this surface at 7f; last win came here in April last year from a mark of 65; some positive runs in defeat on turf this term, 3l third at Leopardstown last month and 4.5l fourth at Limerick last time; Keane now takes over.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-11-08",
              "horse": "El Bello",
              "horse_id": "hrs_25759692",
              "race": "Bet On The Best Night Out At Dundalk Stadium Handicap (Div I)",
              "race_id": "rac_11100063",
              "course": "Dundalk (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_29588",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "El Bello was tough all the way to the line. Two horses came alongside him and he battled well. You'd like to think he could get an extra furlong - Dan King, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "A lightly raced gelding, things are really starting to click with him now. He won back-to-back races at Wolverhampton and Newcastle, both over 7f. He went up a fair bit to 80 from an opening mark of 71 - the handicapper actually hiked him 8lb for his last win at Gosforth Park. He relished the stiff 7f there and although he won at Wolverhampton I was not sure the track suited him, and my fears were proved correct last week when he was never happy and although he ran on well at the end it is not his course. We will keep him to stiffer venues in the future and he can win again. 25-05-22"
            }
          ],
