          "comment": "First win from nine starts last month off 46; unable to follow up last time; can do better",
          "spotlight": "Gained first win from nine starts off 46 at Gowran in a first-time visor early last month, showing a good turn of foot in the closing stages; raised 6lb for that victory and was unable to follow up at Limerick later that month; he can do better.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-02",
              "horse": "Sierra De Gredos",
              "horse_id": "hrs_41346438",
              "race": "KCLR 96FM Apprentice Handicap (Div II)",
              "race_id": "rac_11660948",
              "course": "Gowran Park",
              "course_id": "crs_4784",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Sierra De Gredos did it well and Julian [Pietropaolo] gave him a lovely ride. He rode a horse for us recently at Leopardstown and got it spot on. He got the race report and subsequent recommendation spot on. When this race turned up, I asked if Julian could ride and the divide came in our favour. I spotted on the way down that he was almost favourite and the one that worried me was Cherry Pink, on the form. At the weights reversal it put us there or thereabouts so I could see why. We put extra headgear on him today just to focus his mind and everything went to plan - Andy Oliver, trainer."
            }
          ],
